					<strong>Unified Interoperability (Important Note):</strong> Under the TRB's Phase 2 Interoperability program, motorists can register their existing physical Autosweep RFID tag with Easytrip (and vice-versa at customer service centers) so that a single sticker works on all expressways. However, <strong>wallets remain separate</strong>: your Autosweep wallet balance is deducted on SMC roads, and your Easytrip balance is deducted on MPTC roads. Both wallets must maintain a positive balance to avoid turnstile rejections.
